// # emit-x86 minus-first const-int plus
//
// Logline: Print unary-minus 7 plus 8 so emit-x86 can lower const-int ALU to 1.
//
// Setup: Product path is oodac emit-x86 on this file, then as and ld. No greet. No concat.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. Print a negated int plus int.
//   3. Expect 1, not 18 or -78.
//
// residual: mul and SysV stay later.

pub fn main() {
    println(-7 + 8);
}
